        "Sharp, pinching groin pain when the hip bends deeply (not the constant, dull ache of arthritis)",
        "Pain with squatting, getting out of cars, or prolonged sitting in low chairs",
        "Clicking or catching: a click you can feel or hear with certain movements",
        "Gradually losing the ability to turn the hip inward (difficulty bringing the knee towards the opposite shoulder)",
