        distinguishingFeatures: "An ache at the back and side of the shoulder with weakness and wasting of the cuff muscles over the shoulder blade (supraspinatus or infraspinatus), often in volleyball players or in people with a fluid-filled cyst beside the labrum on a scan (paralabral cyst). There is no worry that the shoulder will slip."
